#
# Automatic download
#

Camt053FetchSetup = Automatic download
Camt053FetchSetupHelp = When disabled, the scheduled job still logs in and lists what the server holds, but downloads nothing, records nothing and deletes nothing. The connection test reports the remote layout either way.
