Camt053AutoPaymentSetup = Automatic payment recording
Camt053AutoPaymentSetupHelp = When the scheduled job meets an entry that matches no bank line, it can settle the document the transfer message names. It only does so when nothing is left to decide: one reference, one open document of the company currency, and an amount equal to what that document still owes. Anything else is reported and waits for a human.
